questions.prompt:
How many times will the following loop execute?

for i in range(3, 9, 2):
    print(i)

What is the correct output of this nested loop?

for i in range(1, 3):
    for j in range(1, 3):
        print(i, j)

questions.starter:
# Print even numbers from 2 to 20
for i in range(_____, _____, _____):
    print(i)

questions.solution:
# Print even numbers from 2 to 20
for i in range(2, 21, 2):
    print(i)
